      "Html": "\u003Cstyle class=\u0022code-analysis-syntax\u0022\u003E\n.docs-content pre{overflow-x:auto;margin:1rem 0 1.75rem;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;border:1px solid rgba(20,42,72,.16);border-left:4px solid #0e6fae;border-radius:4px;background:#f7fbfe;color:#10263a}\n.docs-content pre code{white-space:pre;color:inherit;background:transparent;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.65}\n.language-csharp .syntax-comment{color:#587287;font-style:italic}.language-csharp .syntax-string{color:#8a3d12}.language-csharp .syntax-keyword{color:#6542a6;font-weight:700}.language-csharp .syntax-number{color:#096b65}.language-csharp .syntax-type{color:#0a6680;font-weight:600}\n\u003C/style\u003E\u003Cheader class=\u0022docs-page-header\u0022\u003E\u003Ch1\u003E[page[title]]\u003C/h1\u003E\u003Cp\u003EA service containing only pass-through methods is redundant and should be retired.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/header\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EWhat the Standard says\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u0026ldquo;Pass-Through\u0026rdquo; \u0026mdash; A processing service exists to add a distinct processing capability. A service that merely forwards a complete operation set without adding processing value creates an unnecessary architectural layer. \u003Ca href=\u0022https://github.com/hassanhabib/The-Standard/blob/master/2.%20Services/2.2%20Processings/2.2%20Processings.md#22201-pass-through\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noreferrer\u0022\u003Eread it here\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EWhy it matters\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EA service that only forwards a complete CRUD surface adds a name and dependency without adding policy, orchestration, or protection. Removing that pass-through keeps the flow of control visible and prevents a redundant layer from becoming a future dumping ground.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EBad code example\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E\u003Ccode class=\u0022language-csharp\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-comment\u0022\u003E// Violates STX0003: A service containing only pass-through methods is redundant and should be retired.\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Einternal\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Einterface\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EIStudentProcessingService\u003C/span\u003E\n{\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EIQueryable\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E\u0026gt;\u0026gt; \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ERetrieveStudents\u003C/span\u003E();\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EAddStudent\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E newStudent);\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EUpdateStudent\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E updatedStudent);\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EDeleteStudent\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E deletedStudent);\n}\n\n\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Einternal\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eclass\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudentProcessingService\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EIStudentService\u003C/span\u003E studentService)\n    : \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EIStudentProcessingService\u003C/span\u003E\n{\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Epublic\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EIQueryable\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E\u0026gt;\u0026gt; \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ERetrieveStudents\u003C/span\u003E() =\u0026gt;\n        studentService.\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ERetrieveStudents\u003C/span\u003E();\n\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Epublic\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EAddStudent\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E newStudent) =\u0026gt;\n        studentService.\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EAddStudent\u003C/span\u003E(newStudent);\n\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Epublic\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EUpdateStudent\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E updatedStudent) =\u0026gt;\n        studentService.\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EUpdateStudent\u003C/span\u003E(updatedStudent);\n\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Epublic\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EDeleteStudent\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E deletedStudent) =\u0026gt;\n        studentService.\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EDeleteStudent\u003C/span\u003E(deletedStudent);\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EGood code example\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E\u003Ccode class=\u0022language-csharp\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-comment\u0022\u003E// Follows STX0003\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-comment\u0022\u003E// No code, file deleted\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E"
    }
  ],
